Description: Amnezia VPN client
 AmneziaVPN is an open-source VPN client with support for self-hosted VPN
 servers, AmneziaWG, WireGuard, OpenVPN, XRay and other protocols.
 This package is built from the official development branch for Ubuntu 26.04.
